{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>SimpleToDo 將待辦清單、行事曆與優先次序整合在一起，並透過互動小工具讓任務保持可見。適合需要規劃工作日、課堂或日常採購的人士；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-232.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>主畫面直接管理任務</h2>\n<p>SimpleToDo 提供任務清單、今日待辦、週曆與月曆小工具，支援在部分小工具中直接完成任務，也可把常用項目放到鎖定畫面或控制中心。它可連接 Apple Reminders，讓含有日期的提醒事項與任務一同顯示；並以標籤、優先矩陣、重複任務及英文語句快速建立帶提醒的任務，還可在 Apple Watch 查看與完成任務。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-181-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-182-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-183-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-184-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-185-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SimpleToDo – Todo &amp; Calendar</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/simpletodo-todo-calendar/id1294530516?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:08:43.146514+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T02:58:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T09:17:32.367611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:02:18.353278+00:00","content_hash":"896db394bad03df6645488d9d0821bd650c5a060561d77449144382668b60184","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}